GIVEN `the person under an option holds or acquires a right to acquire or dispose of a share, debenture or participatory interest or an interest in one` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 165(6)(b) the person is a person who holds or acquires shares, debentures or participatory interests or an interest in them` MEANS
    IF `the person under an option holds or acquires a right to acquire or dispose of a share, debenture or participatory interest or an interest in one`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "a reference to a person who holds or acquires shares, debentures or participatory interests or an interest in shares, debentures or participatory interests includes a reference to a person who under an option holds or acquires a right to acquire a share, debenture, or participatory interest"

-- (7): the same words as s 164(14); this function answers by that one, which applies s 7 without subsections (1) and (3).
