GIVEN facts IS A `s 7 interest facts`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 165(7) the person has an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` MEANS
    `s 164(14) the person has an interest in the debenture or participatory interest` facts

-- src:14369 | (8) Nothing in section 164 or this section requires a company to
-- src:14370 | enter in its register or requires a director to give notice to the company
-- src:14371 | of matters that are shown in the register kept by the company in
